  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Evidence: Sexual and Gender-based Violence at South African Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work across four provinces Limpopo, Gauteng, Eastern and Western Cape to develop and research and test a range of approaches addressing the issue of gender based violence in schools. The wok will be carried out in conjunction with the Gender Health and Justice Research Unit (GHJRU) at the University of Cape Town.</narrative>
  </description>
